Phase 11 — Trained Model Artefacts

Place the following here after training:

  model.joblib     — trained classifier (RandomForest / XGBoost / etc.)
  scaler.joblib    — fitted StandardScaler or MinMaxScaler
  features.json    — ordered feature list used during training (must match FEATURE_NAMES)
  metrics.json     — evaluation results (accuracy, F1, ROC-AUC, etc.)
